[profiles.guide]
notes = '''Hold {select} and {start} together to pause the gyro while you reposition the controller. Tilting the controller moves the cursor, as a fine pointer next to the right stick {rs}.
The right stick {rs} moves the pointer and the left stick {ls} the camera. {rt} or {south} clicks; {lt} right-clicks, which drops the tool in hand.
{lb} and {rb} step through the tools of the open toolbar group. Hold them to move to the previous or next group.
{west} rotates what you're placing; hold it to turn the other way. {r3} flips it where it can be flipped.
Click {l3} to pause. Tap {north} for the next speed: fast, fastest, then normal again. Press {north} with the {dpad} for one speed (left is normal, up fast, right fastest, and down pauses); hold {north} to see them.
{up} and {down} zoom. Hold them to show a higher or lower layer of the map. {left} and {right} turn the camera; hold them to turn it 90°.
{select} lists the settlement panels (F1 to F10), the wellbeing box and batch control.
Naming a district or a beaver: {guide} + {west} opens the on-screen keyboard.'''

